<section class="intro">
  <h1>Warrior <span class="sep">*</span> Sorcerer <span class="sep">*</span> Rogue</h1>
  <p class="tagline">A sword &amp; sorcery roleplaying game.</p>

  <p>
    Built on Chaosium's Basic Roleplaying Universal Game Engine under the ORC
    License. The book is a focused, opinionated extraction of BRP for one
    specific genre - the sword &amp; sorcery of <strong>Robert E. Howard</strong>,
    <strong>Fritz Leiber</strong>, and <strong>Michael Moorcock</strong>.
    Percentile skill resolution, matching-dice criticals, costly sorcery,
    theatre-of-mind combat, ancient-world setting.
  </p>

  <p>
    Use the table of contents on the left to navigate the chapters, or the
    search box above to find a specific rule. If you're new, start with
    <a href="{{ '/01-introduction/' | url }}">Introduction</a>.
  </p>
</section>
